WEBVTT

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.970
You must all be tired.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.020
Let me put us on some tea.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.370
Well, well...

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.000
We finally got here.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.880
I'll help you, Nyx.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.360
Jade?

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.400
Jade, is something wrong?

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.390
Angelique...

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.830
Are you okay?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.550
You should go lie down...

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.830
I have to go.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.910
I have to go.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:16.660
Jade?

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.250
Jade, what's wrong?

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:18.810
Jade!

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.510
Hey, wake up!

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:22.960
Jade! Jade!

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:09.440
We finally got him to the couch.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:12.680
But why's he so heavy?

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.530
Jade...

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.160
We need a doctor.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.360
I agree.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.300
I'll go call one.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.510
No, there's no need for that.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.740
Why, Lein?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.420
Jade is an Artifact.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.610
Impossible.

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:42.060
He's a Jasper Doll; an ancient Artifact in the form of a bionic weapon.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:47.010
I heard one was excavated from ruins a few years ago, but...

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.920
I've never heard of a machine with emotions...

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:52.660
Is this the power of ancient technology?

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:56.700
Lein, he'll wake up, won't he?

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:03.540
Repairing an Artifact as complex as this is outside my area of expertise, but I'll do what I can.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.060
It's no good.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.540
How is he?

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:18.140
I've checked all the parts I can get to, but there's nothing wrong with his body.

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:19.930
Then, what's wrong with him?

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.070
I haven't a clue.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:24.280
Does this mean he won't wake up?

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:25.660
No!

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.080
In other words, you're out of ideas.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:33.000
What?

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:37.040
What are they?

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.990
Sunflower seeds?

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.380
I've heard that they only blossom in the southern village of Kozu.

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.890
They're flowers with large heads shaped like the sun.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.140
I have to go.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.090
Could Jade have...

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.620
I'm going to Kozu.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:05:03.510
If I go to Kozu, I may find some way to wake him.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.060
Kozu's on the south coast.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:09.120
It's not exactly a day-trip.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.690
If there's a chance, no matter how small...

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.280
Please.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.270
Angelique...

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:19.140
I'm pushing as hard as I can.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.070
Don't let go of the reins.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:24.880
Got it!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.630
Jade...

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.460
Don't worry.

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:32.970
I'll protect you with my life.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.460
What the heck is causing this?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.970
Lein, if there's anything you need, please let me know.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.770
I'll fetch it as soon as I can.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.620
You knew, didn't you, Nyx?

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.030
Knew what?

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:55.200
That job we took for the Foundation; you forced me to go instead of Jade,

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:59.650
because you figured that the Foundation would have captured him if they'd found out.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:04.170
What are you talking about?

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.190
As soon as the horses are rested, we'll head on.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:13.810
It's only for a short while, but please try to relax a little, Lady Angelique.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.820
I'll keep watch.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.750
No, we'll take turns.

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.860
You must rest, too.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:26.090
There's no need for that. My duty is to protect you.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:32.630
Um, I've been thinking about this for a while... I'd prefer it if you didn't give me too much special treatment.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:37.970
And calling me "Lady Angelique" too... We're, well, companions...

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.600
I am your servant.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:45.910
For the time being, save your pity for Jade.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:49.550
Yes.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.740
This smells good.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:57.810
This is...

00:06:58.050 --> 00:06:59.480
That's the scent of oranges.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.800
And I can smell salt too.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.420
We're almost at Kozu.

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.380
What kind of village is it?

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:09.450
Kozu belongs to the Dragon Clan, so it has its own unique culture.

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:14.910
I've heard that many of the residents are particularly good at divination and soothsaying.

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:19.050
We're here.

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:19.990
Right.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.650
I've been waiting for you.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:26.740
Us?

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.290
Who are you?

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.060
What happened to Jade?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:35.730
You two have come a long way.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:40.980
I am the Elder of the Dragon Clan... and Jade's father.

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.040
The Elder?

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.180
F...

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.460
Father?

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:51.820
Indeed, Jade is my son.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.280
But Jade is...

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.300
He looks a lot like you!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.400
That bright smile of his...

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:02.000
Doesn't he?

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.680
Elder, the reason we've come-

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.500
I know.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:15.020
Ever since the day he left on his journey, I figured someone would come visit us.

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:17.840
It was three years ago...

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:24.000
We found him unconscious near the Forest of Rainbow Flowers.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:34.030
He had no expression at all. He was like a doll.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:40.710
So, at first, he was an Artifact in every sense of the word...

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:45.850
Elder, how can we wake him?

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:49.740
Jade was holding these before he collapsed.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.540
Sunflower seeds...

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:59.620
Miss, there's somewhere I'd like you to go on Jade's behalf.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.210
Lowki, you're there, aren't you?

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:09.830
Take them to Kai's.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.090
Well, Lein?

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:23.390
Damn it!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.680
What's this?

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.340
This is where Kai sleeps.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.460
He was Jade's first friend.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.730
His first friend?

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:49.380
It was thanks to Kai that Jade started smiling.

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:55.910
He is now my son!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.920
Um.. I'm Kai. Nice to meet you.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:03.730
Ow...

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:12.020
From then on, Kai went to see Jade every day,

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:16.120
saying that he'd be the first to see him smile. He told Jade all kinds of things.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:20.850
I thought there was no way a machine could laugh.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.990
But one day, there was a miracle.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:30.400
The rocking, rocking, scent of salt...

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:37.020
The child of the sun that rocks its fruit...

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:43.790
The yellow sphere that shines brilliantly in the sky...

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:46.520
Return to the sea...

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:50.280
Return to my friend...

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.100
They bloomed yesterday!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:00.940
I wanted to these to you first, Jade.

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:06.050
<i>Jade?</i>

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:08.320
That's your name.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.290
The Elder gave it to you.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:15.230
Jade.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.290
These are sunflowers.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:20.220
They only bloom in Kozu.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.950
They look like the sun!

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:27.370
Sunflowers. Sun.

00:11:27.630 --> 00:11:28.980
Want to go see them?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.520
Lowki!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.480
Lowki!

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:40.730
Lowki!

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.260
Lowki!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.930
Kai?

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.740
Jade, Jade...

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:54.260
Sunflowers.

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:57.790
A flower like the sun.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:09.260
Jade... smiled.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:12.750
He smiled! He smiled!

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.360
Jade smiled!

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:25.480
After that, Jade started displaying more and more emotions.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.950
He'd help with construction in the village,

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:33.810
and help pick oranges.

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:50.330
Jade and Kai were always together and Jade would always smile.

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:57.710
But Kai...

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:03.540
Kai?

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:04.940
What's wrong?

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.240
Jade...

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:12.590
Hey, smile.

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:17.010
Smile, Jade.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:21.020
Smiles are the seeds of happiness.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:28.920
Kai?

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:30.930
What's wrong?

00:13:31.050 --> 00:13:32.060
Kai?

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:34.590
Hey, Kai!

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.090
Sing the song you always do.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:42.470
I want to hear your song, Kai.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:47.230
So come on, stand up, Kai.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:50.850
Jade, Kai is dead.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.370
Dead?

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:56.750
He won't wake up ever again.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:01.990
He won't wake up... ever...

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:16.990
Jade's friend.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.790
Kai died of plague.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.490
Right after that, Jade went on a journey.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:29.540
He left on a mission to make as many people smile as he could.

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:36.850
He said that, just as Kai had made him smile, he wanted to make others smile.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.290
He wanted to make someone smile.

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:44.340
Sunflowers are the flowers of their memories.

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:47.080
It's Kai's birthday today.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.770
Sunflower seeds...

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:55.080
Jade wanted to see Kai, didn't he?

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.340
To celebrate his birthday...

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:09.240
Jade has fine companions.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.510
I can see him smiling with you.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.460
Jade was always smiling.

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:18.340
But now...

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:23.750
I thought that if we came here, we might find out how to heal him.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.290
What a troublesome son...

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.400
To make you worry so much...

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:37.330
The rocking, rocking, scent of salt...

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:43.740
The child of the sun that rocks its fruit...

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.400
What a wonderful song...

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:48.360
This song is proof that the hearts of Jade and Kai spoke to each other.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:50.630
The yellow sphere that shines brilliantly in the sky...

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:50.820
Their hearts...

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:53.810
Return to the sea...

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:57.590
Return to my garden.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.170
I have to save them.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:14.160
But I can't move.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.120
They bloomed yesterday!

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:21.140
I wanted to show you these first, Jade.

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.870
My friend, Kai.

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:27.570
Don't you think sunflowers are like smiles?

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.130
Just looking at them makes you happy.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.700
Hey, Jade. Smile.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.770
Smiles are the seeds of happiness.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.490
They can do anything.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:42.810
Even my fake smile can make someone else smile.

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.430
That's what Kai taught me.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:50.800
After his death, I decided to help as many people as I could, and left on a mission.

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:58.530
I left on a mission and met a wonderful girl.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.690
But I...

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.790
I'm an Artifact like him.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:17.900
My smile is fake.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.610
Jade, don't be sad.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:24.700
Kai?

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:32.090
Traveler heading for home...

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:32.610
Jade!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.600
The flower of friendship...

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:34.610
Jade...

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:41.020
Of the land of Kozu.

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:36.940
Kai?

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.140
Smile, Jade!

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:42.930
Jade, please!

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:48.040
Take its seeds on the day of parting...

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.230
Wake up!

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:54.140
and return there someday.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:53.900
When did this memory happen?

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.120
A dream that's not in my memory...

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:04.740
Jade!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.290
Jade!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:11.750
I'm so glad... I didn't know what I'd do if you didn't wake up.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:13.940
Angelique...

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:19.450
My body is a machine. I should never dream visions that aren't linked to my memory.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:22.300
This isn't a dream.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.560
Lein!

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.160
Shall I make some herbal tea to wake you up?

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:28.550
Nyx...

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:32.590
Or will you bake us a cake to celebrate?

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.010
Hyuuga...

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:36.670
That song.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.910
Lowki taught it to me.

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:40.700
It's such a wonderful song...

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:43.220
Gentle and warm...

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:45.240
You went to Kozu?

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:52.130
I went to say happy birthday to Kai on your behalf.

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.070
Hey, Jade.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.650
If you aren't feeling well in the future, let me know, okay?

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:03.510
It was pretty difficult carrying you, after all.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.100
Yeah...

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:21.180
Where are you going, Jade?

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:23.560
I thought so.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.610
I figured it was something like this...

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.800
Jade!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:30.970
Jade!

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:33.760
Why, Jade?

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:35.830
I'm sorry.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:37.580
I'm not human.

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:39.870
I'm an Artifact.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:42.540
I can't stay here any more.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:46.570
You remember the man we fought in the forest?

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.000
The one who looked like me?

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.400
During that battle, I remembered my past.

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:55.730
He's what I used to be.

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:59.490
He was modeled on you, wasn't he?

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.470
We're both Artifacts.

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:06.130
It's strange that we can have feelings at all.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:10.310
I don't know when I'll return to being like that again.

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:13.570
I don't want to cause you trouble.

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.380
I don't want to destroy your smiles.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:18.540
So, I'm leaving.

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.560
Jade! Wait!

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.640
I don't care if you're a machine.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:27.980
You're Jade.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:37.020
When it feels like your heart is going to fail, I'll sing Kai's song and resurrect it.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.970
I'll always be beside you.

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:44.420
We're companions, right?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:48.960
But the Foundation is after me.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:53.150
To them, you're a valuable research specimen.

00:20:53.750 --> 00:21:01.620
They'll try to take you back in order to mass produce copies to fight as anti-Thanatos weapons.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:06.330
But we won't let that happen.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.200
We're companions, after all.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:13.370
Right?

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:16.830
So, stay here, Jade!

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:24.320
If I'm here, I'll...

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.560
I'll never lose heart again.

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:35.840
Angie...

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:57.550
I'll see for myself what effect it has on this world...

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:38.720
The Foundation is developing Artifact Weapons...

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:40.570
What's wrong, Jade?

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:43.550
I thought it was just Jet, but...

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:45.130
I see. There's more...

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:46.700
Next time: Jinx.

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:49.150
There won't be anyone else like us, okay?
